% f: (comment AudioRecording "In ver 1.111 of Mid-level-ontology.kif , it says that (&%subclass &%AudioRecording &%Text). This does not seem right. Deleting that statement. Creating a parent class called &%Recording which means something that captures a &%Process that happened in real life. &%AudioRecording and &%VideoRecording will inherit from there. A &%Photograph is also a still recording of what happened in real life - as opposed to Graphic Art which is more of an &%ArtWork than a &%Recording, so it will also inherit from &%Recording. (09-14-2011)" "KJN")
% 3179 of 37835 from file /home/apease/.sigmakee/KBs/Mid-level-ontology.kif at line 14266
% not higher order
% f: (comment AudioRecording "In ver 1.111 of Mid-level-ontology.kif , it says that (&%subclass &%AudioRecording &%Text). This does not seem right. Deleting that statement. Creating a parent class called &%Recording which means something that captures a &%Process that happened in real life. &%AudioRecording and &%VideoRecording will inherit from there. A &%Photograph is also a still recording of what happened in real life - as opposed to Graphic Art which is more of an &%ArtWork than a &%Recording, so it will also inherit from &%Recording. (09-14-2011)" "KJN")
% quoted thing
% empty, already written or filtered formula, skipping : ( s__comment(s__AudioRecording,'"In ver 1_111 of Mid_level_ontology_kif , it says that (&%subclass &%AudioRecording &%Text)_ This does not seem right_ Deleting that statement_ Creating a parent class called &%Recording which means something that captures a &%Process that happened in real life_ &%AudioRecording and &%VideoRecording will inherit from there_ A &%Photograph is also a still recording of what happened in real life _ as opposed to Graphic Art which is more of an &%ArtWork than a &%Recording, so it will also inherit from &%Recording_ (09_14_2011)"','"KJN"') )
