% empty, already written or filtered formula, skipping : ( s__documentation(s__Tiger,s__EnglishLanguage,'"The tiger (Panthera tigris) is the largest cat species, most recognisable for their pattern of dark vertical stripes on reddish_orange fur with a lighter underside_ The species is classified in the genus Panthera with the lion, leopard, jaguar and snow leopard_ Tigers are apex predators, primarily preying on ungulates such as deer and bovids_ They are territorial and generally solitary but social animals, often requiring large contiguous areas of habitat that support their prey requirements_ This, coupled with the fact that they are indigenous to some of the more densely populated places on Earth, has caused significant conflicts with humans_ [Wikipedia]"') )
